origin = "The Gulper was originally hired as the zoo’s head of waste management, but it quickly lost that job for being \"too efficient.\" It doesn't distinguish between trash, snacks, or expensive rare specimens. If it fits in the mouth, it belongs in the stomach. It’s not mean; it just has a very ambitious metabolism."
